## Important concepts to remember

| Concept           | Python syntax      |
| ----------------- | ------------------ |
| Remainder         | `n % 10`           |
| Remove last digit | `n // 10`          |
| Power             | `n ** 2`           |
| Length            | `len(n)`           |
| Reverse           | `[::-1]`           |
| Loop              | `for i in range()` |
| While             | `while condition:` |
| Swap              | `a, b = b, a`      |
| Maximum           | `max(arr)`         |
| Minimum           | `min(arr)`         |
| Sum               | `sum(arr)`         |
| Sort              | `sorted(arr)`      |
